## Executive Summary

After thorough investigation of C/AS2 Table 2.1 firecell floor area limit implementation, **critical gaps** have been identified in both Note 1 and Note 2 implementation. While comprehensive backend logic exists for Note 2, **form data collection is completely missing** for both notes, making Note 2 functionally inaccessible in production and Note 1 entirely unimplemented.

**Impact Level:** HIGH - Affects compliance validation for all sprinklered buildings (Note 1) and all WB/VP unsprinklered buildings over 5000m² (Note 2).

