### 2. Processing Logic (`api/processors/fire-safety-systems/firecell-floor-area-limits.js:16-25`)

```javascript
// C/AS2 Table 2.1 Note 2: WB and VP unsprinklered buildings
// When 15m or greater from relevant boundary, firecell floor area is unlimited
const isWBorVP = firecell.riskGroup === 'WB' || firecell.riskGroup === 'VP';
const isUnsprinklered = firecell.isSprinklered === false;
const is15mOrMore = firecell.distanceFromBoundary15mOrMore === true;

if (isWBorVP && isUnsprinklered && is15mOrMore) {
  firecell.compliance['firecell-floor-area'] = true;
  return;
}
```

**Analysis:**
- Correctly checks risk group (WB or VP only)
- Correctly checks sprinkler status (unsprinklered only)
- Correctly applies unlimited area when ≥15m
- Early return prevents further validation

### 3. Calculator Functions (`api/processors/firecells/calculator.js:16-28`)

```javascript
function needsBoundaryDistanceQuestion(riskGroup, isSprinklered, floorArea) {
  // Only WB and VP require boundary distance question
  if (!['WB', 'VP'].includes(riskGroup)) {
    return false;
  }

  // Only for unsprinklered buildings
  if (isSprinklered) {
    return false;
  }

  // Only for buildings >= 5000 m²
  return floorArea >= 5000;
}
```

**Analysis:**
- Smart conditional logic
- Only prompts when Note 2 could actually apply
- Prevents unnecessary questions for other risk groups

### 4. Compliance Calculation (`api/processors/firecells/calculator.js:133-158`)

```javascript
// If WB or VP unsprinklered
if (['WB', 'VP'].includes(riskGroup)) {
  // Compliant if floor area <= 5000
  if (floorArea <= 5000) {
    return {
      isCompliant: true,
      reason: 'within_limit',
      limit: baseLimit,
    };
  }

  // OR if floor area > 5000 AND 15m+ from boundary
  if (floorArea > 5000 && isDistanceFromBoundary15mOrMore) {
    return {
      isCompliant: true,
      reason: 'unlimited_with_boundary_distance',
      limit: 'Unlimited²',
    };
  }

  // Otherwise non-compliant
  return {
    isCompliant: false,
    reason: 'exceeds_limit_insufficient_boundary_distance',
    limit: baseLimit,
  };
}
```

**Analysis:**
- Three-tiered logic: within limit, unlimited via Note 2, or non-compliant
- Clear reason codes for each path
- Proper limit notation (Unlimited²)

